[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     15[0m:[38;5;10m[49m 
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     16[0m:[38;5;10m[49m `main` has exactly one branch point, and it is inside `scanf`, whose return
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     17[0m:[38;5;10m[49m value is discarded:
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     18[0m:[38;5;10m[49m 
